# --- S2S variant notes ---
# This agent acts with its own identity and sends mail from its OWN mailbox.
# The agent must have an agent user provisioned with a Microsoft 365 license (mailbox).
# The Mail MCP token is acquired from the agent's own identity via DefaultAzureCredential.
# For LOCAL runs, `az login` as an identity that can obtain a token for the Agent 365
# Tools resource (ea9ffc3e-8a23-4a7d-836d-234d7c7565c1). See README.md.
